From 543a4523893ed061c2e3ff205aaea5f60368a4cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mcp): add the last six units (pages, library, language
 center)

The president and three vice-president offices have no announcements,
only fixed content pages; they are ingested from Strapi sections by
exact page path (deprecated pages and the editors e-mail field are
excluded) and served through new search_pages/get_page tools.

The library and language-center sites are server-rendered HTML. A new
html-news adapter walks the full list every run, then fetches at most
60 detail pages in priority order (new, edited on the list, unverified
for 7 days); the rest is recorded as pending and picked up 15 minutes
later. Requests are spaced one second apart and detail ids must match
per-source query rules. Announcements listing masked student names are
quarantined as PERSONAL_DATA instead of being republished.

The ingestion loop is now adapter-driven (list/detail steps) so all
three source kinds share raw archiving, validation, drift checks,
batched publishing and disappearance handling.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
